WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:04.132
Three drones receive inspection routes through a three-dimensional workspace.

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:10.771
They visit targets at different heights, accounting for obstacles and separation between vehicles.

00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:17.532
The mission also considers limited energy, so each drone must retain enough for its return.

00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:27.553
After visiting the targets, the team returns to charging positions. This is an illustrative mission, not an experimental result.
